WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.790
A Titan carries a flame down a
mountain, stolen from the gods.

2
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:08.740
In another myth, he shapes
the first humans out of clay.

3
00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:12.260
The Romantics loved him as a heroic rebel.

4
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.630
Now cut to an attic workshop.

5
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:19.300
A student bends over a covered
table, as rain patters on the window.

6
00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:22.270
Prometheus stole fire for humanity.

7
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.300
So what did Victor steal?

8
00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:28.790
In this mission, you'll set both versions
of the myth beside Victor's story.

9
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:34.190
And you'll hear Victor dream: "A new
species would bless me as its creator and

10
00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.440
source".

11
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:38.380
Your mission: work out what Victor stole.
